!Name: rake-c12d-var
!C A diagonal c/12 period 1920 (20*96) sideways rake which is one of
!C an infinite series of rakes using a bounded population.  Other
!C rakes in the series can be simply built by advancing or delaying
!C the topmost Cordership by multiples of 64 generations, which
!C increases or decreases the period by 96.  Alternatively, you can
!C simply shift the topmost ship diagonally by multiples of 16 cells
!C to adjust the period by multiples of 288.  This is a smaller
!C version of the original rake from June 2005.
!C David I. Bell, September 2020
!Source: jslife-moving
!
